<title>CHINA: China Light offers staff departure scheme.</title>
<headline>China Light offers staff departure scheme.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Light &amp; Power Co Ltd said on Friday it was offering 3,600 staff in its transmission business group and its distribution and customer services business group a voluntary departure package.</p>
</text>
